# Every path, deliberately. A change to ANY file here executes inside the CI of
# every repository that calls this one, so there is no low-stakes corner.
#
# Note this is currently advisory: branch protection sets
# required_approving_review_count to 0, because the repo has a single
# maintainer and a required review nobody can give is a lock, not a control.
# The controls that DO bind are enforce_admins=true plus required status
# checks — see SECURITY.md. This file exists so that the moment a second
# maintainer is added, ownership is already stated rather than inferred.
